%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
# Patch 18052026
This notebook applies a patch to WLJS application core files. Changes implemented:
- Fixed unicode support for view decorations
- Fixed major bugs with `.wl` files editor
- Improved performance of the editor

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  Hidden: true
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
.md
Please, __run initialization cells__ or cell below to apply this patch

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Please, __run initialization cells__ or cell below to apply this patch

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  InitGroup: true
  Fade: true
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
blob = NotebookRead[NotebookStore["lordosis-148"]];
temp = CreateDirectory[];
tempFile = OpenWrite[FileNameJoin[{temp, "t.zip"}], BinaryFormat->True];
If[FailureQ[tempFile], MessageDialog["Could not create temporary file"]; Abort[]];
BinaryWrite[tempFile, blob];
tempFile = Close[tempFile];
pathDir = FileNameJoin[{temp, "patch"}];
If[FailureQ[ExtractArchive[tempFile, pathDir]], MessageDialog["Could not extract archive"]; Abort[]];

MergeDirectories[source_String, target_String] := (
  Echo[StringTemplate["Copy directory `` to ``"][source, target]];
  If[!DirectoryQ[target], CreateDirectory[target]; ];
  
  With[{names = FileNames[All, source]},
    With[{folders = Select[names, DirectoryQ[#] &], files = Select[names, !DirectoryQ[#] &]},
      Map[Function[folder,
        With[{folderName = FileNameTake[folder, -1] },
          MergeDirectories[folder, FileNameJoin[{target, folderName}]]
        ]], folders];

      Map[Function[file,
        CopyFile[file, FileNameJoin[{target, FileNameTake[file, -1]}], OverwriteTarget->True];
        Echo[StringTemplate["Copied `` to ``"][file, FileNameJoin[{target, FileNameTake[file, -1]}]]];
      ], files];
    ]
  ];
);

MergeDirectories[
  pathDir,
  FileNameJoin[{Internal`Kernel`RootDirectory, "modules"}]
];

MessageDialog["Success! Please, restart WLJS and force-reload window (or clear cache)"];

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  Hidden: true
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
.md
Then restart this app and clear cache (`View`-`Force-Reload` or `Reload`). Here is a simple test. 

If you see normal Cyrillic letters, it means that this patch was succesfull:

